## 9.  Quick Checklist Before Going Live  

- [ ] **Client ID** is set and **client secret** never appears in client‑side code.  
- [ ] **Redirect URI** matches exactly what you entered in the SoundCloud app.  
- [ ] All **track URLs** you embed are either public or you have a valid OAuth token for private ones.  
- [ ] **CORS** works (test on a real domain, not just `localhost`).  
- [ ] **Autoplay** is disabled or triggered by a user gesture (required on mobile browsers).  
- [ ] **Responsive design** – make sure the iframe or custom player scales on mobile.  
- [ ] **Error handling** – show a friendly message if a track fails to load.  

